---
import PageLayout from "../layouts/PageLayout.astro";
---
<PageLayout
  title="Membership"
  description="Standard teaches you to build it and sell it. Premium buys back your time."
>
  <a class="page-eyebrow brandlink" href="/">The Digital Income Edit™</a>
  <h1>Membership</h1>
  <p class="lede">Standard teaches you to build it and sell it. Premium buys back your time.</p>
  <p>You learn the build from inside the building. This classroom sits inside the business it teaches — the site, the funnels, the automation you'll construct are the same ones delivering this page to you right now.</p>
  <p>The membership grows with you, one rung at a time — no leaps, no overwhelm. You climb when the current step stops being your bottleneck.</p>
  <div style="border-top:1px solid var(--gray);margin-top:40px">
    <div style="padding:26px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--gray)">
      <div style="font-family:'Fraunces',serif;font-size:22px;margin-bottom:6px">Free</div>
      <p style="margin:0;font-size:15px;color:var(--taupe-deep)">Start-here trainings, the full build curriculum, and daily prompts. Your first win, fast.</p>
    </div>
    <div style="padding:26px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--gray)">
      <div style="font-family:'Fraunces',serif;font-size:22px;margin-bottom:6px">Standard — $9/mo</div>
      <p style="margin:0;font-size:15px;color:var(--taupe-deep)">Learn to monetize and systematize — full content, offer, and funnel training, plus every course in the education library.</p>
    </div>
    <div style="padding:26px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--gray)">
      <div style="font-family:'Fraunces',serif;font-size:22px;margin-bottom:6px">Premium — $27/mo</div>
      <p style="margin:0;font-size:15px;color:var(--taupe-deep)">Everything in Standard, plus The Ads Edit™, done-for-you assets, monthly content calendars, and scaling systems. Buy back your time.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <a class="btn" href="https://www.skool.com/thedigitalincomeedit/plans?utm_campaign=skool_link_sidebar_links&utm_content=84529be4ccf6404fbd5b7235626ae55d" style="margin-top:40px">Join the Membership <span class="a">→</span></a>
  <p style="margin-top:60px"><a href="/learn" style="color:var(--pink);font-weight:500">← Back to The Library</a></p>
</PageLayout>
